      "detail": "活人劍 s1 o2: (古庭禪師語錄輯略) (古庭善堅), (拈頌) (cb:mulu); (師拈云) on a (夾山) / (洛浦) exchange. (善堅)'s own (拈), but off-roster, so MasterName null. The pair answered as one set, with the (殺)/(活) outcome spelled out (死者死，活者活)."
